@page
@model PrivacyModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p>Last updated: @DateTime.UtcNow.ToString("MMMM dd, yyyy")</p>

<h2>1. Data We Collect</h2>
<p>
    We only collect a <strong>username</strong> and a <strong>password</strong>.
    We do not collect any personal data like your name, email, or phone number.
</p>

<h2>2. How We Use and Store Your Data</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Your credentials are used solely to authenticate your account.</li>
    <li>Passwords are securely <strong>hashed and salted</strong> before storage.</li>
    <li>We cannot view or recover your plain-text password.</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. Open Source & Self-Hosting</h2>
<p>
    This project is open-source.
    If you are using a self-hosted instance of this application, the administrators of that specific instance control your data.
    No data is ever transmitted back to the original project maintainers.
</p>

<h2>4. Data Retention</h2>
<p>
    Your credentials are stored until you choose to delete your account.
    Once deleted, the records are permanently removed from the database.
</p>

<h2>5. Contact Us</h2>
<p>
    For privacy questions or to review the code handling your data, please visit our
    <a href="https://github.com/dhavalparikh414/TodoAppWithLogin">GitHub Repository</a>.
</p>

